<title>POLAND: Rafako extends gains on investor plan.</title>
<headline>Rafako extends gains on investor plan.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boilermaker Rafako SA soared 9.9 percent to 19.9 zlotys in a heavy 10-million-zloty trade, extending its surge on the back of Wednesday's announcement it was seeking a strategic investor.</p>
<p>&quot;The growth is based on the news of the search for investor, but I think it might slow it next week,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Some analysts said Rafako could soar again, when it announces who would be taking the strategic stake.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
